OL,3,GNEWSABridge collapses into water after
OL,4,Amalfunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landmark bridge which was left
OL,7,Fpartially hanging after a major
OL,8,Fmalfunction earlier this year has now
OL,9,Fcollapsed, leaving part of it submerged
OL,10,Fin water.
OL,12,FPhotographs show a section of Pero's
OL,13,FBridge in Bristol Harbour twisted
OL,14,Fdownwards, leaving one of its
OL,15,Fhorn-shaped sculptures in the water.
OL,17,FWorkers were set to remove damaged
OL,18,Fparts of the bridge last week after it
OL,19,Fwas closed in August when a lifting
OL,20,Fmechanism failed.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
