OL,3,GNEWSABridge collapses into water after
OL,4,Amalfunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol City Council said the collapse
OL,7,Fhappened shortly before 23:00 GMT on
OL,8,FSaturday, adding there is "no confirmed
OL,9,Fimpact to the maintenance and
OL,10,Frefurbishment programme" which would
OL,11,Fsee it reopen in Spring 2027.
